Project Overview

Develop a responsive web application for tracking workouts and managing personal fitness progress.

The application will allow users to manage exercises, record sets and repetitions, track completed workouts, and monitor their training activity.

Main Features :

- Add, edit, and delete exercises.
- Track sets, repetitions, and workout duration.
- Create and manage workout sessions.
- Save workout data using LocalStorage.
- Display basic workout statistics and progress.
- Responsive interface for desktop and mobile devices.

Technologies :

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript (Vanilla JS)
- LocalStorage

Project Goals :

Build a functional and user-friendly fitness application while improving frontend development skills, JavaScript fundamentals, DOM manipulation, and responsive web design.

